{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1564584-scion-galactic-war-an-idea-that-came-to-me-while-sick","id":1564584,"title":"Scion: Galactic War - An Idea that came to me while sick","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-10-07T08:08:44-07:00","id":1564584,"title":"Scion: Galactic War - An Idea that came to me while sick","content":"So I was sick recently and my brain decided to turn <b>Scion 2e</b> into sci-fi, and I actually really like where it went.<br /> <br /> Thousands of years ago, something happened that humanity now calls <b>The Great Cataclysm</b>. We lost huge parts of our history, cultures, languages, and mythology. We still have fragments of old stories and gods. We have statues with no names and myths we can't seem to figure out how to connect to a god.<br /> <br /> Fast forward to now. Humanity has Earth and the Moon and is only just starting to reach toward the stars.<br /> <br /> Then we get introduced to the <b>Galactic War</b>.<br /> <br /> It's a game. Once a year, civilizations challenge each other and send their chosen Heroes to fight. The winner gets to claim resources from the losing civilization.<br /> <br /> Earth was extremely resource rich, so we've become a popular target. We've already lost enough matches that we're down from 10 resource points to 5, causing shortages, starvation, and all kinds of problems back home.<br /> <br /> The problem is that the other civilizations have their own <b>Scions, gods, Callings, Purviews, and mythologies</b>.<br /> <br /> Humanity has mostly forgotten ours.<br /> <br /> That's where the players come in.<br /> <br /> So I started to think the blood in the player scions awakens calling to their divine heratage they must find and fully awaken before the next match so they can help defend earth.<br /> <br /> <b>You have to know a god to call upon them.</b><br /> <br /> The more a Scion discovers and understands about their divine heritage, the more they can awaken their <b>Callings, Purviews, Birthrights, and Legend</b>.<br /> <br /> So between the yearly Galactic War matches, humanity is desperately trying to recover its lost mythology.<br /> <br /> Then the next match comes around, and the players are fighting Scions whose gods come from alien mythologies humanity has never even heard of.<br /> <br /> They know their gods.<br /> <br /> We don't.<br /> <br /> So who has the stronger gods?<br /> <br /> Whose mythology is more powerful?<br /> <br /> And what really happened during the Great Cataclysm?<br /> <br /> Just from the mind of medicated writer lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-10-11T05:49:28-07:00","id":1564687,"title":"","content":"There is a fanmade space opera shard by Aetava (I'll take it down if they ask). It's not exactly what you're looking for, but you might can mine it for ideas. It includes writeups for a couple of alien pantheons and cosmologies.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1BkxE-c2zvVzdImwohCr8mf2lviCOf39RLGvnYNy5QLg/mobilebasic\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1BkxE-c2zvVzdImwohCr8mf2lviCOf39RLGvnYNy5QLg/mobilebasic\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/